/T (The objective of this lab is to install WampServer on a Windows machine and use it to set up a local MySQL database server. By the end of this lab, the student should be able to install WampServer, start its services, and access the MySQL database through phpMyAdmin to prepare the environment for future database exercises. )
/E (The objective of this lab is to install WampServer on a Windows machine and use it to set up a local MySQL database server. By the end of this lab, the student should be able to install WampServer, start its services, and access the MySQL database through phpMyAdmin to prepare the environment for future database exercises. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 338 0 R
/T (WampServer is a Windows-based web development platform that bundles the Apache web server, the PHP scripting language, and a MySQL/MariaDB database server into a single, easy- to-install package. It also includes phpMyAdmin, a web-based graphical tool used to create, manage, and query MySQL databases without typing raw SQL commands from the terminal. )
/E (WampServer is a Windows-based web development platform that bundles the Apache web server, the PHP scripting language, and a MySQL/MariaDB database server into a single, easy- to-install package. It also includes phpMyAdmin, a web-based graphical tool used to create, manage, and query MySQL databases without typing raw SQL commands from the terminal. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 338 0 R
/T (For a Database Systems course, WampServer provides a convenient way to run a real MySQL server locally, without needing an internet connection or a remote server. This lab focuses on downloading and installing WampServer, starting its services, and confirming that the MySQL database engine and phpMyAdmin interface are working correctly. )
/E (For a Database Systems course, WampServer provides a convenient way to run a real MySQL server locally, without needing an internet connection or a remote server. This lab focuses on downloading and installing WampServer, starting its services, and confirming that the MySQL database engine and phpMyAdmin interface are working correctly. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
