/Title (WampServer is a Windows-based web development platform that bundles the Apache web server, the PHP scripting language, and a MySQL/MariaDB database server into a single, easy- to-install package. It also includes phpMyAdmin, a web-based graphical tool used to create, manage, and query MySQL databases without typing raw SQL commands from the terminal.)
